<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.recovery.views`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "sign a recovery contact's own view of a face with its card"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.recovery.views", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.recovery.views"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.recovery.views"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.recovery.views ~ a recovery contact speaks for the head it sees

`lares persona recovery-contact view --prefix persona-<64 hex>` reads the contact's card on a terminal and signs the contact's own view of that face's head, printing the view line a restore confirms by.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ view

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`view` params=`prefix/persona-<hex> ~ sign a contact's view of one face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ prefix

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`prefix` params=`takes/prefix needs/required ~ the face it speaks for, persona-<64 hex>`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the contact types their card at their own terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.recovery.views prefix/persona-<hex>]] ~ --prefix names no persona-<64 hex>`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ viewed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`viewed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[prefix seq eventCid view]] ~ the view line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares persona recovery-contact view

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares persona recovery-contact view]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

